      "volume_candidate": 11,
      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "八月乙丑，振徐、兗水災。戊辰，都御史洪英，尚書孫原貞、薛希璉等分行天下，考察官吏。丁丑，振兩畿水災州縣，免稅糧。乙酉，振南畿、河南、山東流民。",
      "boundary_basis": "epub_source_paragraph",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "flags": [],
      "locator": {
